{'symbol': 'K', 'date': '2021-07-30 14:08:00', 'title': 'KELLOGG COMPANY DECLARES REGULAR DIVIDEND OF $0.58 PER SHARE', 'text': 'BATTLE CREEK, MICH., JULY 30, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KELLOGG COMPANY (NYSE: K) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF $0.58 PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY, PAYABLE ON SEPTEMBER 15, 2021, TO SHAREOWNERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON SEPTEMBER 1, 2021.'}